- **Blank filter**: a feature is removed unless its maximum or average signal in the samples is
  more than 5 × its average signal in the blanks; it is mostly
  contamination.
- **QC RSD% filter** (optional, off in this example): a feature is removed when its RSD% among the
  QC replicates is above the limit; it is measured too imprecisely.

